# Real ev.def_opt_frame damage; no direct movable damage calls.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
movable on
living on
noise on
destruction on
overlay off
view full

destruction2 setup crate fist
wait 600
rec destruction2-crate-fist
destruction2 attack
wait 600
destruction2 checkpoint
stop

